73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 等待 OPA 实例拉取新 Bundle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sleep 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 验证策略已生效（audit 模式检查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          kubectl apply -f tests/test-pod.yaml --dry-run=server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  deploy-production</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deploy-staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.event_name == 'push' &#x26;&#x26; contains(github.event.head_commit.message, '!deploy-prod')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Promote to Production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aws s3 cp s3://opa-bundles/staging/bundle.tar.gz s3://opa-bundles/production/</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"策略例外管理\">策略例外管理</h2><p>策略例外是不可避免的——总会有合理的场景需要暂时违反策略。关键是要有规范的例外管理机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"例外申请流程\">例外申请流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者遇到策略拒绝] --&gt; B[评估是否真的需要例外]&#10;    B --&gt; |可以修复| C[修复配置&lt;br/&gt;满足策略要求]&#10;    B --&gt; |确实需要例外| D[提交例外申请]&#10;    D --&gt; E[填写例外工单&lt;br/&gt;原因+范围+期限]&#10;    E --&gt; F[负责人审批]&#10;    F --&gt; |批准| G[创建 PolicyException&lt;br/&gt;或白名单条目]&#10;    F --&gt; |拒绝| H[与申请人沟通&lt;br/&gt;寻找替代方案]&#10;    G --&gt; I[设置过期提醒]&#10;    I --&gt; J[到期自动清理]\">graph TD\n    A[开发者遇到策略拒绝] --&gt; B[评估是否真的需要例外]\n    B --&gt; |可以修复| C[修复配置&lt;br/&gt;满足策略要求]\n    B --&gt; |确实需要例外| D[提交例外申请]\n    D --&gt; E[填写例外工单&lt;br/&gt;原因+范围+期限]\n    E --&gt; F[负责人审批]\n    F --&gt; |批准| G[创建 PolicyException&lt;br/&gt;或白名单条目]\n    F --&gt; |拒绝| H[与申请人沟通&lt;br/&gt;寻找替代方案]\n    G --&gt; I[设置过期提醒]\n    I --&gt; J[到期自动清理]</pre><h3 id=\"例外记录要素\">例外记录要素</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>例外 ID</td>\n<td>唯一标识</td>\n<td>EXC-2026-0042</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略名称</td>\n<td>被豁免的策略</td>\n<td>require-resource-limits</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源范围</td>\n<td>例外适用的资源</td>\n<td>namespace: data-team, pods: spark-*</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外原因</td>\n<td>为什么需要例外</td>\n<td>Spark 驱动节点需要动态资源调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申请人</td>\n<td>提出例外的人/团队</td>\n<td>data-platform-team</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批人</td>\n<td>批准例外的负责人</td>\n<td>security-lead</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期时间</td>\n<td>例外自动失效的时间</td>\n<td>2026-12-31</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复审状态</td>\n<td>是否经过定期复审</td>\n<td>已复审 / 待复审</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"kyverno-policyexception-示例\">Kyverno PolicyException 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v2beta1&#10;kind: PolicyException&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: spark-driver-exception&#10;  namespace: data-team&#10;  labels:&#10;    exception-id: &#39;EXC-2026-0042&#39;&#10;    approved-by: &#39;security-lead&#39;&#10;    expires: &#39;2026-12-31&#39;&#10;spec:&#10;  policyRefs:&#10;    - name: require-resource-limits&#10;      kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;  match:&#10;    any:&#10;      - resources:&#10;          kinds:&#10;            - Pod&#10;          namespaces:&#10;            - data-team&#10;          names:&#10;            - &#39;spark-driver-*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v2beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PolicyException</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">spark-driver-exception</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    exception-id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXC-2026-0042'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    approved-by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'security-lead'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    expires</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-12-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  policyRefs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">require-resource-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          names</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spark-driver-*'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"策略退役与清理\">策略退役与清理</h2><p>策略不是越多越好。过时的、不再需要的策略应该及时退役，避免策略膨胀和维护负担。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退役触发条件\">退役触发条件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零拦截记录</td>\n<td>策略连续 90 天没有拦截任何请求，可能已不再需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈变更</td>\n<td>策略针对的技术（如特定 Ingress Controller）已被替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规要求变化</td>\n<td>相关合规条款已更新或不再适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被新策略替代</td>\n<td>新策略覆盖了旧策略的所有检查范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"退役流程\">退役流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 确认策略无拦截记录（查询决策日志）&#10;grep &quot;require-old-policy&quot; decision-logs/*.json | wc -l&#10;&#10;# 2. 将策略切换为 audit 模式（如果当前是 enforce）&#10;# 修改策略配置，设置为 audit 模式&#10;&#10;# 3. 观察 2 周，确认无影响&#10;# 监控告警和用户反馈&#10;&#10;# 4. 从策略仓库中移除&#10;git checkout -b retire/remove-old-policy&#10;# 删除策略文件和相关测试&#10;git commit -m &quot;retire: 移除 require-old-policy 策略&#10;&#10;该策略连续 90 天无拦截记录，且相关合规要求已由&#10;新策略 require-new-standard 完全覆盖。&#10;&#10;Refs: EXC-2026-0015&quot;&#10;&#10;# 5. 归档到 archive/ 目录（保留历史）&#10;git mv policies/old-policy/ archive/2026-07-old-policy/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 确认策略无拦截记录（查询决策日志）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"require-old-policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> decision-logs/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 将策略切换为 audit 模式（如果当前是 enforce）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改策略配置，设置为 audit 模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 观察 2 周，确认无影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 监控告警和用户反馈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 从策略仓库中移除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> retire/remove-old-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 删除策略文件和相关测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"retire: 移除 require-old-policy 策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">该策略连续 90 天无拦截记录，且相关合规要求已由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">新策略 require-new-standard 完全覆盖。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Refs: EXC-2026-0015\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5. 归档到 archive/ 目录（保留历史）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/old-policy/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> archive/2026-07-old-policy/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>策略生命周期管理确保了策略体系的有序运转。要全面了解策略的运行状态和合规效果，还需要建立<a href=\"pac-observability\">策略可观测性与审计</a>体系。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((策略生命周期))&#10;    阶段&#10;      提出 Propose&#10;      开发 Develop&#10;      评审 Review&#10;      部署 Deploy&#10;      运行 Operate&#10;      退役 Retire&#10;    提案管理&#10;      RFC 模板&#10;      背景动机&#10;      影响评估&#10;      成功指标&#10;    版本控制&#10;      Git 仓库结构&#10;      分支策略&#10;      提交规范&#10;      CODEOWNERS&#10;    评审批准&#10;      检查清单&#10;      代码质量&#10;      逻辑正确性&#10;      影响评估&#10;    灰度发布&#10;      Audit 模式&#10;      Warn 模式&#10;      非生产 Enforce&#10;      全量 Enforce&#10;    例外管理&#10;      申请流程&#10;      PolicyException&#10;      过期自动清理&#10;    退役清理&#10;      零拦截触发&#10;      归档保留&#10;      避免策略膨胀\">mindmap\n  root((策略生命周期))\n    阶段\n      提出 Propose\n      开发 Develop\n      评审 Review\n      部署 Deploy\n      运行 Operate\n      退役 Retire\n    提案管理\n      RFC 模板\n      背景动机\n      影响评估\n      成功指标\n    版本控制\n      Git 仓库结构\n      分支策略\n      提交规范\n      CODEOWNERS\n    评审批准\n      检查清单\n      代码质量\n      逻辑正确性\n      影响评估\n    灰度发布\n      Audit 模式\n      Warn 模式\n      非生产 Enforce\n      全量 Enforce\n    例外管理\n      申请流程\n      PolicyException\n      过期自动清理\n    退役清理\n      零拦截触发\n      归档保留\n      避免策略膨胀</pre><ul>\n<li>策略生命周期包含提出、开发、评审、部署、运行、退役六个阶段，每个阶段有明确的活动和产出。</li>\n<li>好的策略提案有明确的触发事件、可衡量的目标和清晰的范围，是策略质量的起点。</li>\n<li>策略代码应纳入 Git 版本控制，遵循与应用代码相同的分支策略、提交规范和 CODEOWNERS 审批机制。</li>\n<li>灰度发布四阶段（Audit → Warn → 非生产 Enforce → 全量 Enforce）是降低策略上线风险的标准实践。</li>\n<li>策略例外必须显式管理：有申请流程、有审批记录、有过期时间、有定期复审。</li>\n<li>策略退役同样重要：零拦截的策略应及时清理，避免策略膨胀和维护负担。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略生命周期管理","id":"策略生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"策略生命周期阶段","id":"策略生命周期阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"策略提出与提案","id":"策略提出与提案"},{"level":3,"text":"策略提案模板","id":"策略提案模板"},{"level":2,"text":"策略开发与版本控制","id":"策略开发与版本控制"},{"level":3,"text":"仓库结构","id":"仓库结构"},{"level":3,"text":"分支策略","id":"分支策略"},{"level":3,"text":"提交规范","id":"提交规范"},{"level":2,"text":"策略评审与批准","id":"策略评审与批准"},{"level":3,"text":"评审检查清单","id":"评审检查清单"},{"level":3,"text":"CODEOWNERS 与审批","id":"codeowners-与审批"},{"level":2,"text":"策略部署与灰度发布","id":"策略部署与灰度发布"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度发布四阶段","id":"灰度发布四阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"部署自动化","id":"部署自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"策略例外管理","id":"策略例外管理"},{"level":3,"text":"例外申请流程","id":"例外申请流程"},{"level":3,"text":"例外记录要素","id":"例外记录要素"},{"level":3,"text":"Kyverno PolicyException 示例","id":"kyverno-policyexception-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"策略退役与清理","id":"策略退役与清理"},{"level":3,"text":"退役触发条件","id":"退役触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"退役流程","id":"退役流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"策略测试与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/policy-testing"},"next":{"title":"策略可观测性与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/pac-observability"}}